        "TileImage": "$($repository 053f542d-fd44-4096-ba3c-2dcd8bfc5fef).Image",
        "Description": "Your objective today is to eliminate Mr. and Mrs. Hoffman.\r \rYou see, Mr. Hoffman is an extremely wealthy man. However, he is also the leader of one of the largest drug trafficking and money laudering groups in the U.S, titled the A.H Foundation.\rHe has recently transferred to Bangkok to hide from the law.\r\rMrs. Hoffman must also be eliminated, as she is the public alibi for his group, she is only married to him for, well, money. She gets paid by Alexander to do this.\r\rFarewell, Agent 47.",
